e link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.05 kg (0.1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-1bc5f1f592bc214bEND_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-be66bfbd2ad3c83aEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_LOW_HagSurvivors_BanditsTreasureLetter</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_HagSurvivors_BanditsTreasureLetter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_HagSurvivors_BanditsTreasureLetter\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">08f39789-1a37-4b61-b004-a6894898f662</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:08f39789-1a37-4b61-b004-a6894898f662\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:08f39789-1a37-4b61-b004-a6894898f662\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hiero_Lue\" title=\"Hiero Lue\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Hiero_Lue.png/25px-Portrait_Hiero_Lue.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Hiero_Lue.png/38px-Portrait_Hiero_Lue.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Hiero_Lue.png/50px-Portrait_Hiero_Lue.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hiero Lue\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Hiero_Lue.png/25px-Portrait_Hiero_Lue.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Portrait_Hiero_Lue.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hiero_Lue\" title=\"Hiero Lue\">Hiero Lue</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Old_Garlow%27s_Place\" title=\"Old Garlow's Place\">Old Garlow's Place</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Got 'em.<br><br>We're in <a href=\"/wiki/Old_Garlow%27s_Place\" title=\"Old Garlow's Place\">Old Garlow's place</a>. <a href=\"/wiki/Aideen_Ni_Chuirc\" title=\"Aideen Ni Chuirc\">Their wizard</a>, ever paranoid, hid their stash in the basement under the stairs. <a href=\"/wiki/Maggie_Ni_Chuirc\" title=\"Maggie Ni Chuirc\">One of the crew</a> caught on that I knew, and has been watching me like a hawke ever since.<br><br>Tell <a href=\"/wiki/Nine-Fingers_Keene\" title=\"Nine-Fingers Keene\">Ninefingers</a> to hit this place, and hit it <i>hard</i>, before the '<a href=\"/wiki/Dead_Eyes\" title=\"Dead Eyes\">Dead Eyes</a>' add my peepers to their collection.\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>See also:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bloodied_Journal\" title=\"Bloodied Journal\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Book_Generic_B_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_B_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7c/Book_Generic_B_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Generic_B_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7c/Book_Generic_B_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Generic_B_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Book_Generic_B_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_B_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7c/Book_Generic_B_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Bloodied_Journal\" title=\"Bloodied Journal\">Bloodied Journal</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pristine_Letter\" title=\"Pristine Letter\"><picture><source srcset=